  "content": "<p>本扩展包让您能更深入地沉浸在中世纪的氛围中，它为原版模组增添了海量来自13至16世纪欧洲各地的新盔甲、武器和装饰品。</p><p><strong>完整镀金模板极少由盔甲匠村民出售</strong><br>本项目需要安装<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/epic-knights-armor-and-weapons\" rel=\"nofollow\">史诗骑士</a>模组及其所有依赖项。大部分纹理和模型由爱好者创作，特别感谢SuperSus890和SteveMc做出的卓越贡献。</p><p><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1441/931/armor-1-png.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1920\" height=\"984\"></p><p><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1452/66/armor-2-png.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1920\" height=\"984\"></p><p><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1441/938/armor-3-png.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1920\" height=\"984\"></p><p><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1039/408/weapons.png\" width=\"1400\" height=\"864\"></p><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1446/543/decorations-png.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1400\" height=\"1573\"></p>",
